---
import { nav, site } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
const year = 2026;
---
<footer class="relative mt-24 overflow-hidden bg-sage-700 text-sand-100">
  <div class="grain absolute inset-0"></div>
  <div class="container-x relative grid gap-12 py-16 md:grid-cols-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-sand-100/15 text-sand-100">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 4c4 3 4 13 0 16-4-3-4-13 0-16Z"/><path d="M12 4v16"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="font-serif text-xl">{site.name}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-pretty leading-relaxed text-sand-100/75">
        Yargısız, sıcak ve gizlilik odaklı bir terapi alanı. Kendinize dönmek için
        güvenli bir başlangıç noktası.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-sand-100/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-sand-100/85">
        <Icon name="lock" class="h-4 w-4" />
        Tüm görüşmeler gizlilik ilkesiyle korunur
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider2 text-sand-100/60">Sayfalar</h3>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
        {nav.map((item) => (
          <li>
            <a href={item.href} class="text-sand-100/80 transition-colors hover:text-white">{item.label}</a>
          </li>
        ))}
        <li><a href="/randevu" class="text-sand-100/80 transition-colors hover:text-white">Randevu</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider2 text-sand-100/60">İletişim</h3>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <Icon name="pin" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sand-100/60" />
          <span class="text-sand-100/80">{site.address.full}</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <Icon name="phone" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sand-100/60" />
          <a href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`} class="text-sand-100/80 transition-colors hover:text-white">{site.phone}</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <Icon name="mail" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sand-100/60" />
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="text-sand-100/80 transition-colors hover:text-white">{site.email}</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <Icon name="clock" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-sand-100/60" />
          <span class="text-sand-100/80">{site.hours}</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-x relative border-t border-sand-100/12 py-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-sand-100/55 sm:flex-row">
      <p>© {year} {site.name}. Tüm hakları saklıdır.</p>
      <p class="text-center sm:text-right">
        Bu bir demo / portfolyo sitesidir · Tasarım & geliştirme
        <a href="https://dijifa.com" class="underline decoration-sand-100/30 underline-offset-2 hover:text-white">dijifa</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
